          "type": "code",
          "text": "Event envelope",
          "language": "json",
          "code": "{\n  \"id\": \"evt_8f3a1c2d\",\n  \"type\": \"StateChanged\",\n  \"time\": \"2026-09-10T08:15Z\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"entityId\": \"ent_4821\"\n  }\n}",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 180
        },
        {
          "id": "a_2t16uj9fc139",
          "type": "note",
          "text": "Typically at-least-once and unordered across partitions: consumers dedupe on the event id and tolerate reordering. Publishing is not atomic with the state change that caused it — see Transactional Outbox.",
          "noteKind": "note",
          "width": 200,
          "height": 56
        }
      ]
    },
